    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a practical, hands-on relationship with math—mostly through chemistry and problem-solving in daily life. I enjoy its logic but don’t see it as abstract theory. My upper secondary education gave me a solid foundation, and I use it for hobbies like coding and board games. I’m comfortable with applied math but shy away from pure theory.",
