    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used AI tools like Wolfram Alpha and ChatGPT for quick checks on chemistry equations and basic algebra. It helped me verify answers and learn new concepts quickly. I found it efficient but didn’t rely on it heavily—I preferred hands-on practice to deepen my understanding.",
